Z||000014||Cliff Pennock||08-22-2001||05:07 PM||||Yeah, it's weird why they sound so bad. Even my girlfriend (who's everything but an audio freak) spontaneously said to me today these speakers sound much worse than the old ones.<P>Maybe I should invest some more in a subwoofer since it sounds like it's mainly bass that's missing.||||reg||5
