Z||000017||Joe Torma||08-22-2001||05:36 PM||||Cliff, you've got a billion settings with that head unit...3 LOUDS, Easy EQ, HPF.<BR>I bet you can get it to sound "better".<P>I would put those speakers in some sort of enclosure..see crutchfield for the foam ones.  Someone mentioned in another thread about just stuffing polyfill in the holes.  The lack of enclosure is why you are missing the midbass.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Joe Torma (edited 08-22-2001).]||||reg||1
